      "id": 1,
      "text": "Founded in 1994, the Allen Historical Society works to preserve and promote the rich history of Allen and its surrounding areas.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://museumsdatabase.com/museums/view/13762",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The society hosts lectures, tours, and festivals each year, inviting residents to learn about Allen’s past.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://museumsdatabase.com/museums/view/13762",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Members enjoy access to a library filled with historical books and records that document the town’s heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://museumsdatabase.com/museums/view/13762",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Its headquarters are the Allen Community House, a 1932 school building that now houses the society’s archives.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://museumsdatabase.com/museums/view/13762",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Three local sites—Asbury Methodist Episcopal Church, Bennett’s Adventure, and Bounds Lott—are listed on the National Register of Historic Places.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
